        <p>
            Note: On the actual page, you will need to provide an empty ARIA live region called an alert to accept any
            changes:
            <code>&lt;div id="example" role="alert"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code>
            See the example for
            <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices/#alert">
